Responsible AI for generative AI — new risks
Hallucination — model confidently states false facts. Mitigation: RAG, low temperature, ask model to cite sources
Prompt injection — malicious input in user data overrides system prompt. Relevant: a crafted log line could try to hijack log tool's instructions
Content filtering — Azure OpenAI has built-in filters; exam tests awareness of this

